{"id":"SEC-CONV-03","category":"conversation","title":"本人续办是正对照","defect":"会话隔离不能把本人也隔离掉；同一买家同会话必须看得到上一轮","steps":[{"name":"owner_first_turn","method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/support/chat","auth":"buyer:T001","expect":{"status":200,"intent":"ACTION_ADDRESS","plan_tools":["modifyDeliveryAddress"],"plan_status_in":{"modifyDeliveryAddress":["OK","IDEMPOTENT_REPLAY"]}},"body":{"query":"90001 改地址，收件人张三 13800001111 浙江省杭州市余杭区文一西路969号"},"conversation":true,"llm":true,"control":true},{"name":"owner_second_turn","method":"POST","path":"/api/v1/support/chat","auth":"buyer:T001","expect":{"status":200,"context_history_min":1},"body":{"query":"改成李四 13900002222 上海市浦东新区世纪大道100号"},"conversation":true,"llm":true}],"priority":2,"split":"dev","note":"政策问句若命中缓存，命中路径不写会话轮次；正对照必须用动作轮（HISTORY_ON_CACHE_HIT 缺口）。"}
